[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0634","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0634.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55792","title":"Craft CMS dataUrl 函数沙箱逃逸致敏感文件泄露漏洞","description":"Craft CMS 是一款内容管理系统（CMS），其 Twig 沙箱白名单中包含了 `dataUrl()` 函数，导致存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于 Craft CMS 4.x 和 5.x 版本中，`dataUrl()` 函数被列入 Twig 沙箱白名单，且 `Html::dataUrl()` 方法未对点文件（如 `.env`）进行过滤检查。拥有 `utility:system-messages` 权限的非管理员控制面板用户可在系统邮件模板中嵌入文件读取载荷，当邮件发送时，服务器会读取目标文件（如 `.env`）并以 base64 编码的数据 URL 形式嵌入邮件正文中。攻击者通过获取 `.env` 文件中的数据库密码、`CRAFT_SECURITY_KEY` 及第三方 API 密钥，可伪造会话令牌并升级为完全管理员账户接管。该漏洞影响 Craft CMS 4.0.0-RC1 至 4.18.0 之前版本及 5.0.0-RC1 至 5.10.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.0，危害等级中危。攻击条件为：目标站点至少有一个非管理员用户被授予了 `utility:system-messages` 权限，且已配置邮件发送功能。官方已在 4.18.0 和 5.10.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55792","GHSA-287w-mxq6-x2cp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-02T00:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-02T15:17:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Craft CMS 至 4.18.0 或 5.10.0 及以上版本（GitHub PR #18559）。如无法立即升级，在 `src/config/twig-sandbox.php` 中将 `dataUrl` 从 `allowedFunctions` 数组中移除，并审查所有非管理员用户的 `utility:system-messages` 权限分配。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/craftcms/cms/pull/18559","https://github.com/craftcms/cms/security/advisories/GHSA-287w-mxq6-x2cp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2026/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-557xx/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-55792.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/craftcms/cms/CVE-2026-55792.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0634.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0108","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55726","title":"Gardyn 物联网中心设备日志存储容器未授权访问漏洞","description":"Gardyn 物联网中心使用的 Azure Blob Storage 容器未配置任何访问认证机制，导致设备日志文件可被公开列举。攻击者无需身份验证即可通过网络远程列出并访问存储容器中的所有设备日志文件，获取设备运行状态、配置信息等敏感数据，属于 CWE-497 敏感系统信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55726"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2026-07-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-06T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 Gardyn Home Firmware 升级至 master.627 及以上版本，Studio Firmware 升级至 master.627 及以上版本，Cloud API 升级至 2.12.2026 及以上版本；确保设备联网以自动下载固件更新，更新移动应用至最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-183-03.json","https://mygardyn.com/security/","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-183-03"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0633","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0633.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55790","title":"Craft CMS CraftSupport 组件 DOM 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Craft CMS 的 CraftSupport 小工具中存在 DOM 型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于 CraftSupportWidget.js 中的 `FeedbackScreen.getSearchResultText` 函数在渲染 GitHub Issue 标题时直接返回 GitHub API 响应的原始 JSON 字符串，且后续使用 jQuery 的 `.html()` 方法将其设置为元素 innerHTML，未进行任何 HTML 编码或过滤。攻击者仅需一个 GitHub 账号（无需 Craft CMS 控制面板权限）即可在 `craftcms/cms` 仓库创建包含 JavaScript 载荷（如 `<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>`）的 Issue 标题。当 Craft CMS 管理员在仪表盘中使用 CraftSupport 小工具的 \"Give feedback\" 反馈搜索功能，输入匹配该恶意 Issue 的搜索关键词时，载荷会在管理员的控制面板会话中执行，窃取 CSRF Token 并劫持管理权限。受影响的版本为 Craft CMS 4.0.0-RC1 至 4.17.15 及 5.0.0-RC1 至 5.9.22。CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高。厂商已在 4.17.16 和 5.9.23 版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55790","GHSA-24x4-j6x9-rfw5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T23:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-02T20:17:03Z","remediation":"立即将 Craft CMS 升级至已修复版本：4.x 分支升级至 4.17.16 或更高版本，5.x 分支升级至 5.9.23 或更高版本。通过 Composer 执行 `composer require craftcms/cms:^4.17.16` 或 `composer require craftcms/cms:^5.9.23` 完成升级。升级前务必备份数据库和项目文件。如暂无法升级，可在 Craft 后台禁用仪表盘中的 CraftSupport 反馈组件以消除攻击入口，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）对控制面板会话中的 HTML 输出进行 XSS 过滤。此外，建议对具有控制面板访问权限的管理员账号启用操作日志审计，以便及时发现异常行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/craftcms/cms/commit/6bbb66038a268552180ca5c8eed9f46ea25a4417","https://github.com/craftcms/cms/security/advisories/GHSA-24x4-j6x9-rfw5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2026/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55790.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-557xx/CVE-2026-55790.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-55790.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0633.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0633.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0792","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0792.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54712","title":"OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation RMI上下文传播拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation 的 RMI 上下文传播载荷读取器在解析时仅限制了上下文条目数量，但未限制从数据流中读取的字符串总大小。攻击者若能访问已启用 RMI 插桩的 Java 虚拟机上的 RMI 端点，可发送超大的上下文传播载荷，导致 JVM 在读取载荷时分配过量内存，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞仅影响启用了 RMI 插桩且 RMI 端点可网络访问的部署环境，影响版本为 2.27.0 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54712","GHSA-fq3f-m5qm-99f5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T22:16:50Z","updated":"2026-07-06T16:58:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation 至 2.27.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 RMI 插桩（`-Dotel.instrumentation.rmi-enabled=false`），或在网络层面限制对 RMI 端点的访问，仅允许受信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/security/advisories/GHSA-fq3f-m5qm-99f5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-54712.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54712.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0792.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0788","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0788.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54704","title":"OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation JDBC 自动埋点密码明文泄露漏洞","description":"OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation 的 JDBC 自动埋点功能在处理 SQL CONNECT 语句时，当数据库密码被双引号包裹时未能正确进行脱敏处理，导致明文密码被记录到追踪跨度属性中并导出至可观测性后端。攻击者若能够访问可观测性系统（如 Jaeger、Zipkin 等），即可窃取数据库明文凭据。该漏洞影响 2.28.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。官方已在 2.28.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54704","GHSA-rwqx-fvqh-6wm4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T22:16:50Z","updated":"2026-07-06T17:00:08Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation 至 2.28.0 或更高版本。如无法升级，在 JDBC 连接字符串中避免对密码使用双引号包裹，或通过配置 `otel.instrumentation.jdbc.omit-connection-password=true` 禁止密码输出到 span 属性。同时检查已导出的 trace 数据，确认是否存在明文密码泄露并轮换受影响数据库凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/security/advisories/GHSA-rwqx-fvqh-6wm4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-54704.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54704.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0788.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0635","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0635.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55793","title":"Craft CMS 后台表格视图存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Craft CMS 5.0.0-RC1 至 5.9.22 版本的控制面板中存在存储型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。具有 Author 角色的用户可在条目标题中存储恶意的 JavaScript 载荷，当管理员或其他具有相同 Structure 板块 saveEntries 权限的用户在表格视图下将另一条目拖拽至被污染的条目下方时，载荷会在受害者会话中执行。漏洞根因在于服务端将标题转义到 data-title 属性后，浏览器解码该属性，jQuery 的 .data('title') 读取到解码后的值，随后该值未经 HTML 转义直接拼接到新 HTML 字符串中。攻击者需拥有控制面板账户（最低 Author 角色），受害者需执行拖拽操作且会话处于提升权限状态。该漏洞已在 5.9.23 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55793","GHSA-xrqc-p465-2xvg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T22:16:50Z","updated":"2026-07-02T16:16:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Craft CMS 至 5.9.23 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ElementTableSorter.js 中 data-title 属性值未转义即拼接至 HTML 的问题。如无法立即升级，可暂时限制 Author 角色用户的 createEntries 和 saveEntries 权限，或避免在 Table 视图下拖拽条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/craftcms/cms/commit/162321e899cc97517fb6f5a02b5528f549d0c6cc","https://github.com/craftcms/cms/security/advisories/GHSA-xrqc-p465-2xvg","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55793.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2026/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-557xx/CVE-2026-55793.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-55793.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0635.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0810","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0810.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58263","title":"Jodit Editor clean-html 突变 XSS 漏洞","description":"Jodit 编辑器内置 clean-html 过滤器存在突变型 XSS 漏洞，攻击者利用 MathML 与 `<style>` 标签的嵌套特性（`math > mtext > table > mglyph > style`），使 `<img onload=...>` 等非 onerror 事件处理器在首次解析时被作为原始文本隐藏在 `<style>` 内，从而绕过仅遍历元素节点的同步清理逻辑；当编辑器将值重新解析写入可编辑区时，`<img>` 被提升为 HTML 命名空间下的活体元素，其事件处理器完整保留。受影响版本为 4.12.27 及更早（4.11.2 起需四层载体，更早版本裸载体即可绕过），默认配置下即可触发。攻击前提：攻击者能向编辑器写入 HTML（如内容提交角色），且应用后续将 editor.value 作为可信 HTML 渲染（如 innerHTML、服务端渲染）。利用方式：构造特定载体负载赋值给 editor.value，随后消费端渲染即自动触发 onload/onfocus 等无交互事件，导致存储型 XSS。CVSS 7.2（HIGH），已在 4.12.28 修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58263","GHSA-rxcw-mc6f-6hr3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T21:17:04Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:52Z","remediation":"立即升级Jodit编辑器到4.12.28或更高版本，该版本修复了MathML载体绕过clean-html sanitization的漏洞。如需立即缓解，请在初始化编辑器时禁用clean-html插件或配置更严格的自定义sanitizer，以阻止MathML内嵌的rawtext载体类型。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/xdan/jodit/security/advisories/GHSA-rxcw-mc6f-6hr3","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-58263.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58263.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58263.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-58263.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58263.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-58263.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58263.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_3_CVE-2026-58263.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-582xx/CVE-2026-58263.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/jodit/CVE-2026-58263.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0810.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0810.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0810.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0800","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54756","title":"Jodit Jodit 编辑器原型污染漏洞","description":"Jodit 编辑器（npm 包）在 4.12.18 版本之前存在原型污染漏洞。其 `Jodit.configure()` 方法及内部 `ConfigMerge`/`ConfigProto` 辅助函数在合并用户提供的配置选项时，未对 `__proto__`、`constructor`、`prototype` 等原型污染键进行过滤。攻击者可通过在 `controls` 等普通对象选项下嵌套恶意载荷（如 `{\"__proto__\":{\"polluted\":\"yes\"}}`）来污染 `Object.prototype`，导致属性注入、逻辑绕过、拒绝服务等安全问题。该漏洞影响所有将用户可控配置传入 `Jodit.configure()` 的应用，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。已在 4.12.18 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54756","GHSA-5957-5c94-3v7w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T21:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-02T15:17:04Z","remediation":"立即将 jodit 升级至 4.12.18 或更高版本，该版本在 ConfigMerge 和 ConfigProto 中过滤了 `__proto__`、`constructor`、`prototype` 等原型污染键。如无法升级，在调用 `Jodit.configure()` 前对用户传入的配置对象做深度递归过滤，移除所有以 `__proto__`、`constructor`、`prototype` 为键的属性。同时避免将未经过滤的用户输入直接传入 `Jodit.configure()`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/xdan/jodit/security/advisories/GHSA-5957-5c94-3v7w","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54756.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54756.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54756.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54756.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-54756.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54756.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54756.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54756.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/jodit/CVE-2026-54756.yml","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-54756.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0804","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0804.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54908","title":"Pion DTLS vulnerable to denial of service via panic while parsing a crafted ECDHE_PSK ServerKeyExchange message 漏洞","description":"Pion DTLS 是使用 Go 语言实现数据报传输层安全（DTLS）协议的库。该库存在越界读取（CWE-125）漏洞，在解析精心构造的 ECDHE_PSK ServerKeyExchange 消息时，程序会因读取越界触发 panic，导致未捕获的运行时错误。攻击仅需构造并发送特制的 ECDHE_PSK 握手消息，无需身份认证即可远程触发，造成进程崩溃，从而对依赖该库的 DTLS 服务造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Pion DTLS v3.1.4 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分为 6.3（中危）。官方已在 v3.1.4 版本中通过 GitHub pull request #839 修复，建议用户升级至 v3.1.4 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54908","GHSA-wg4g-wm44-ch5j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T20:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-02T18:43:54Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Pion DTLS v3.1.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复解析精心构造的 ECDHE_PSK ServerKeyExchange 消息时触发 panic 的问题（详见 https://github.com/pion/dtls/pull/839）。在升级前暂无可用的官方缓解措施，若产品依赖 dtls 库，请同步升级 Go 依赖并重新编译部署，同时勿在不可信网络环境中运行受影响版本，以防远程拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pion/dtls/pull/839","https://github.com/pion/dtls/security/advisories/GHSA-wg4g-wm44-ch5j","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54908.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-549xx/CVE-2026-54908.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0804.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0328","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0328.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49858","title":"API Platform Core 跨用户属性泄漏漏洞","description":"API Platform Core 的 JSON:API 和 HAL 序列化组件中存在跨用户属性泄漏漏洞。`#[ApiProperty(security: ...)]` 注解用于按请求评估属性是否可暴露，但 `ItemNormalizer` 中的 `componentsCache` 数组以 `$context['cache_key']` 为键进行缓存，该键在委托给父级规范化器之前被无条件设置，未包含用户权限信息。因此，一个请求计算出的属性结构（属性、关系、链接）可被后续不同权限用户的请求复用，导致低权限用户看到本应被安全谓词隐藏的属性结构。该漏洞影响 API Platform Core 2.6.0 至 4.1.29、4.2.26 及 4.3.12 之前版本，利用条件包括：应用通过 JSON:API 或 HAL 格式暴露资源、资源属性使用了依赖当前用户的 `security` 谓词、以及运行在 FrankenPHP/RoadRunner/Swoole 等长生命周期 PHP 运行时中（请求间缓存存活）。攻击者可通过构造特定请求顺序触发缓存重用，实现越权信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49858","GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T20:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-02T18:41:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 api-platform/core、api-platform/json-api 和 api-platform/hal 至 4.1.29、4.2.26 或 4.3.12 及以上版本。如无法升级，可覆写 JSON:API 和 HAL 的 ItemNormalizer 服务，在 $context['cache_key'] 前增加资源类安全检查；或临时避免在 JSON:API/HAL 资源上使用 #[ApiProperty(security: ...)]。将部署切换为传统 php-fpm 工作模式也可缓解，因缓存不会跨请求存活。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/api-platform/core/security/advisories/GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49858.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/packagist/api-platform/hal/CVE-2026-49858.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49858.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-49858.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49858.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23/GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49858.json","https://github.com/ProjetsThibaut/sniperland/blob/c5c43f8f2e30e477faf3400b96c1aa0bf8107c93/docs/adr/ADR-035_auth_session_jwt_deferred.md","https://github.com/anchore/vulnerability-index-spec-files/blob/da07e4079d8e007fe062e5c4bb9628bb4caa2d74/data/2026/45/ANCHORE-2026-45773.toml","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/e215f3db28c5769217a5505035d513be33f7dce5/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-19800.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0328.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0764","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0764.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53466","title":"ImageMagick XCF解码器堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞","description":"ImageMagick 是一款开源图像处理软件，其 XCF 解码器在处理特制 XCF 图像时存在整数转换溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。攻击者可构造恶意 XCF 文件，当用户或自动化程序使用受影响版本解析该文件时，整数溢出导致堆缓冲区过度读取，可能造成信息泄露或程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 ImageMagick 6.9.13-51 之前版本及 7.1.2-26 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，无需身份认证且无需用户交互，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意图像触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53466","GHSA-pjxj-pchx-4c3m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T19:16:54Z","updated":"2026-07-02T19:34:08Z","remediation":"升级 ImageMagick 至 6.9.13-51 或 7.1.2-26 及以上版本；Debian 13 用户执行 `apt update && apt upgrade imagemagick` 安装 DSA-6383-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在处理用户上传图片前使用 `identify -verbose` 预检 XCF 文件，或通过策略文件 `policy.xml` 禁用 XCF 解码器：`<policy domain=\"coder\" rights=\"none\" pattern=\"XCF\" />`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-pjxj-pchx-4c3m","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53466.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53466.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53466.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53466.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-53466.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53466.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-534xx/CVE-2026-53466.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-53466","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/nuget/Magick.NET-Q8-x86/CVE-2026-53466.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/nuget/magick.net-q8-x64/CVE-2026-53466.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0764.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0242","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13760","title":"AWS aws-cdk-lib NodejsFunction Docker 捆绑功能操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"AWS CDK（aws-cdk-lib）的 NodejsFunction Docker 捆绑流程中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。当项目使用 nodeModules 参数进行 Docker 构建时，攻击者通过控制 package.json 文件中依赖版本字符串，注入恶意 shell 元字符，可在运行 CDK 工具链的主机上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 aws-cdk-lib 2.260.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。攻击者需具备修改项目 package.json 依赖版本字符串的能力，利用条件相对受限但危害严重。官方已在 v2.260.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13760","GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T19:16:36Z","updated":"2026-07-01T20:17:01Z","remediation":"立即将 aws-cdk-lib 升级至 v2.260.0 或更高版本 (npm update aws-cdk-lib / pip install --upgrade aws-cdk-lib)。如无法立即升级，在 Docker 打包构建过程中严格校验 package.json 中所有依赖版本字符串，过滤 shell 元字符（如 `;&|$`），避免将不可信的用户输入直接传入 NodejsFunction 的 nodeModules 配置项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-050-aws/","https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk/releases/tag/v2.260.0","https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk/security/advisories/GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13760.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/aws-cdk-lib/CVE-2026-13760.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13760.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13760.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13760.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-13760.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/45bc652ff79f8949ca15d5de8959068671b69187/cve/CVE-2026-13760.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf/GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-13760.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/fdc85fda51ce30c8d5596698e5c36e14d548cfe1/2026/07/2026-07-02-report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0242.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0120","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6688","title":"ChaN FatFs 长文件名缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）R0.16 及更早版本在处理长文件名（LFN）时存在下游缓冲区溢出漏洞。当启用 LFN 功能后，`fno.fname` 字段可长达 255 个字符，但许多调用方将其复制到固定长度的短缓冲区时未进行边界检查，导致缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的长文件名文件（如 255 字符的 LFN）触发此漏洞，造成缓冲区写入越界，可能导致内存破坏或代码执行。该漏洞映射为 CWE-120（输入大小未检查的缓冲区复制），CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6688"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:13Z","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:46Z","remediation":"升级 FatFs 到 R0.16 以上版本；在调用 f_readdir() 的代码中，将所有复制 fno.fname 的 strcpy/sprintf 替换为 strncpy/snprintf 并明确限制目标缓冲区大小（如 snprintf(name, sizeof(name), \"%s\", fno.fname)）；如业务不需要长文件名支持，可在 ffconf.h 中将 FF_USE_LFN 设为 0 禁用 LFN 以彻底规避；同时审查项目所有集成 FatFs 的目录遍历代码路径，确保无其他固定缓冲区的越界复制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-long-fn-of-downstream-cve-2026-6688/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6688.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/sbom.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_3_CVE-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6688.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_%E9%95%BF%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E6%B8%B8%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA_CVE-2026-6688.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5a9fba9a290ea9e3c74c99f6d784969fc4412c6c/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8vm2-mjff-2gg2/GHSA-8vm2-mjff-2gg2.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/fuzzer/main.go","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6688"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0119","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6687","title":"FatFs exFAT 卷标栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FatFs R0.16 及更早版本中的 f_getlabel() 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-121）。该漏洞源于程序在处理 exFAT 文件系统卷标时，未对 XDIR_NumLabel 字段长度进行规范上限校验，攻击者可通过挂载特制的 exFAT 镜像文件，设置恶意卷标长度值触发栈缓冲区溢出。该漏洞影响嵌入式系统中广泛使用的 FatFs 文件系统库，物理接触设备的攻击者可利用此漏洞实现任意代码执行或系统崩溃，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6687"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:40Z","remediation":"升级至 FatFs R0.17 或更高版本（官方已修复）。如无法升级，手动修补 `ff.c` 中 `f_getlabel()` 函数，在调用 `ld_utf8()` 写入卷标前增加对 `XDIR_NumLabel` 的校验，限制其最大值为 22（exFAT 规范上限）。临时缓解措施：禁止程序挂载来源不可信的 exFAT 镜像文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-exfat-label-len-of-cve-2026-6687/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6687.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_3_CVE-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6687.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_exFAT_%E5%8D%B7%E6%A0%87%E6%A0%88%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA_CVE-2026-6687.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3346902a1d1e44903f43a6ca4d63e2601447c63c/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wghw-hg6m-7rh3/GHSA-wghw-hg6m-7rh3.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/fuzzer/main.go","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6687"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0118","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6686","title":"FatFs f_lseek 越界后未初始化簇读取信息泄露漏洞","description":"FatFs R0.16 及更早版本中存在未初始化簇信息泄露漏洞。当通过 f_lseek() 函数将文件扩展至 EOF 之后时，新分配的簇未被清零即被使用，导致残留的磁盘数据可能被读取。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 FAT 镜像文件，诱导目标系统处理该文件后读取未初始化的簇内容，从而获取敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有使用 FatFs 库的嵌入式设备，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6686"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:35Z","remediation":"升级至 FatFs R0.16 以上版本，若无法升级则手动修改 ff.c 中 f_lseek() 函数：调用 create_chain() 分配新簇后，使用 move_window() 配合 memset 将每个新分配的簇扇区清零，防止扩展区域暴露已删除文件残留数据。受影响的 ESP-IDF、STM32Cube、Zephyr、MicroPython、ArduPilot、RT-Thread 等下游项目应同步更新其 FatFs 分支。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-uninit-cluster-exposure-cve-2026-6686/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6686.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6686.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/sbom.yml","https://github.